                                                "sense_id": "333fc516-8249-3f7f-acef-2abdf810cefc",
                                                "text": "And Ionathan gaue his artillery vnto his ladde, and said vnto him, Goe, cary them to the citie.",
                                                "translation": "And Jonathan gave his weapons unto his lad, and said unto him, Go, carry them to the city. (American Standard Version)",
