                                                "sense_id": "333fc516-8249-3f7f-acef-2abdf810cefc",
                                                "text": "The old walls […] were surely strong enough to keep out men without battering-rams, balistas, or artillery of any kind. [Footnote] Artillery is here used in its old English meaning for any kind of warlike engine. Cf. I Sam. XX. 40."
                                            }
